    "detailed_description": "Dive into the world of <strong>Osiris</strong>. A distant and colorful world that has been war-torn by the immoral Bloxians.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874890/extras/116c46ace1b023e755d6ab532c8836d7.avif?t=1715337008\" width=800 height=262 /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Dive into an expansive world</strong></li></ul><br>With 5 worlds to explore and discover, exploration is highly free to roam through. Discovering secrets leading you to other endings to the game.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874890/extras/420c834c02d023a54350bf433befe721.avif?t=1715337008\" width=800 height=266 /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Collect each worlds items</strong></li></ul><br>In worlds inspired by <u>Super Mario 64</u> games, find keys to progress through each world and to get to the final level!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874890/extras/d802b480a88e343369e6092bd339f187.avif?t=1715337008\" width=800 height=262 /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Inspired art style</strong></li></ul><br>In an art style inspired by old Super Mario Games, explore your childhood with levels with vibrant colours!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874890/extras/786874306d8c8943aa98248140aacfe6.avif?t=1715337008\" width=800 height=262 /></span>",
